{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117451","id":3401379050,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7KvOzq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117451","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117451.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117451.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117451","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117451/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117451/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117451/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6eafc2e939b74b68ddabc3427e6485df980074a0","number":117451,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Core: Migrate enum and int constants to `GDType` for `Variant`","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Follow up to #113586 \r\n* Work towards https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13216 \r\n\r\nNow that work on replacing `ClassDB` with `GDType` has begun, we can slowly start parallelizing the changes to `Variant`'s implementation, and consolidate our typing systems.\r\n\r\nThis PR focuses on migrating integer constants and enums, currently handled in `variant_call.cpp`, to use `GDType`.\r\n`Variant` now stores a static list of `GDType` pointers for all its types (as defined by `Variant::Type`), which host that data. Doing it this way preserves ABI compatibility as opposed to adding a new member to the class. \r\n\r\nThe `#ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED` branching logic that enabled ordered element retrieval in debug builds has been removed, similarly to what was done for `ClassDB` in #113586. Accordingly, this behavior was also removed for `Variant`-typed constants, and the now single-membered `Struct ConstantData` was replaced with a simple `HashMap`. \r\n\r\nThe next step to \"complete\" this would be to support non-integer constants in `GDType`, but that's for a follow-up PR. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co